ement who is  identified  by  the  value  transfer  originator  as  the  receiver  of  the  digital  tokens transferred; and 'value transfer originator' means the account holder who allows the value transfer from that  account,  or  where  there  is  no  account,  the  natural  person,  legal  person  or  legal arrangement that places the value transfer order with the ordering institution to perform the value transfer."
