    },
    {
      "section_path": "15.6",
      "heading": null,
      "modality": "requirement",
      "text": "Subject to the bank putting in place adequate safeguards to protect the confidentiality and use of any information that is shared, the bank shall develop and implement group policies and procedures for its branches and subsidiaries within the financial group, to share  information  required  for  the  purposes  of  CDD  and  for  money  laundering  and terrorism financing risk management, to the extent permitted by the law of the countries or jurisdictions that its branches and subsidiaries are in."
