    {
      "section_path": "15.8",
      "heading": null,
      "modality": "requirement",
      "text": "Where the AML/CFT requirements in the host country or jurisdiction differ from those in Singapore, the bank shall require that the overseas branch or subsidiary apply the higher of  the  two  standards,  to  the  extent  that  the  law  of  the  host  country  or  jurisdiction  so permits."
